{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cad75df914ec3b8b","name":"AS23 Aerial Survey Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-cad75df914ec3b8b","title":"AS23 Aerial Survey Droid","revision":15621,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:52:55Z","sha256":"2418c7f3a960d70257e62eaaa78b11ff3e63872eedc700f252fda090f296a064","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15621","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=AS23%20Aerial%20Survey%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cad75df914ec3b8b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Many Scouting Droids are geared toward exploring territory on the ground, but the AS23 Aerial Survey Droid from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arakyd Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arakyd_Industries","referenceId":"reference:53475569f2ae9d67"}," accomplishes its task from the air. The triangular AS23 Aerial Survey Droid is streamlined to cut down on wind resistance, letting it easily fly through a planet's atmosphere with speed and maneuverability. The Droid's silhouette also resembles that of avian predators found throughout the galaxy, encouraging local wildlife to give the AS23 a wide berth as it performs its duties.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since the primary function of the AS23 Aerial Survey Droid is to gather geographical data, its onboard equipment is tailored to achieve that goal. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Automap"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Automap","referenceId":"reference:8c70a138a6271e3f"}," installed within its chassis records topographical information, and the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"}," is routed directly to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Automap"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Automap","referenceId":"reference:8c70a138a6271e3f"}," to allow the Droid to gather information on the darkest nights. The information it gathers can be stored within its memory banks for later access, or it can be transmitted by its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Comlink","referenceId":"reference:7fadfdfea7aba7e9"}," to its master for immediate review.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["AS23 Aerial Survey Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["AS23 Aerial Survey Droid Statistics (CL 0)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["3rd-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/3rd-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +14\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic (understand only), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},", 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense